cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this assessment toolkit, please cite it as below."
title: "AI-Ready Data · Enterprise Self-Assessment Toolkit (企业自检工具)"
abstract: >-
  An open-source maturity self-assessment for enterprise "AI-Ready" data
  capability: 45 questions across six dimensions (cost & business value,
  data foundation & quality, platform architecture & operations,
  organization & talent, governance & trust, security & compliance),
  with an N/A-aware scoring script producing dimension get-rates and
  L1–L4 maturity levels.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Amazon Web Services"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-30
license: [Apache-2.0, CC-BY-4.0]
keywords:
  - AI-Ready Data
  - maturity model
  - data governance
  - self-assessment
  - MLOps
repository-code: "https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-ai-ready-data-assessment"
url: "https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-ai-ready-data-assessment"
